---
source: src/view.rs
expression: "render(70, 80, viewport_at(&wrapping(), 70))"
---
"b0d4e2a view: wrap the lines too wide for the screen instead of       "
"cropping them at its edge Chloé Bernard 01/10/2026 (tag: v0.2, origin/"
"line-wrapping)                                                        "
"                                                                      "
"Long lines used to be cropped at the edge of the screen, hiding their "
"end, which is often where the interesting part of a modification is.  "
"They are now displayed on several rows, broken at the Unicode line    "
"break opportunities.                                                  "
"A `↵` marks each row of a diff that continues on the next one.        "
"                                                                      "
